---
import Base from "../../layouts/Base.astro";
import FAQSchema from "../../components/FAQSchema.astro";
import AffiliateCTA from "../../components/AffiliateCTA.astro";
import RelatedGuides from "../../components/RelatedGuides.astro";
import { platformById } from "../../data/platforms";

const p = platformById["manifold"]!;

const faqs = [
  {
    q: "Is Manifold free to use?",
    a: "Yes. Manifold uses Mana (M$), a play-money currency with no real-cash value. You start with a free balance and can create or trade any market without depositing real money.",
  },
  {
    q: "Can you win real money on Manifold?",
    a: "No. Mana (M$) is play money only. It cannot be converted to cash. The platform is for learning and entertainment, not financial gain.",
  },
  {
    q: "Is Manifold available in the US?",
    a: "Yes. Because no real money is involved, Manifold is available globally without geographic restrictions.",
  },
  {
    q: "What can I use Manifold for?",
    a: "Learning how prediction markets work before risking real money; experimenting with market creation; academic research on forecasting; following community predictions on niche topics.",
  },
  {
    q: "How does Manifold compare to Kalshi or Polymarket?",
    a: "Manifold is play-money only. Kalshi and Polymarket involve real money and real financial risk. Use Manifold to learn the mechanics; use Kalshi or Polymarket when you are ready to trade with real funds and have verified your eligibility.",
  },
];
---

<Base
  title="Manifold Markets Review 2026 — Free Play-Money Prediction Markets"
  description="Manifold is the best way to learn prediction market mechanics for free — no real money, no geographic restrictions. Here's what it is and who it's for."
  path="/platforms/manifold"
>
  <article class="prose wrap">
    <p class="eyebrow">Platform overview</p>
    <h1>Manifold Markets: learn prediction markets for free</h1>

    <p class="lede">
      Manifold is a play-money prediction market. You cannot win or lose real money.
      That makes it the best starting point for anyone who wants to understand how
      prediction markets work before committing real funds.
    </p>

    <div class="callout callout--eligibility">
      <strong>No money involved.</strong> Manifold uses Mana (M$), a play-money currency
      with zero cash value. There are no geographic restrictions. Anyone can sign up for free.
    </div>

    <h2>What Manifold is good for</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Learning the mechanics of prediction markets with zero financial risk</li>
      <li>Experimenting with market creation and resolution</li>
      <li>Practicing probability estimation before you trade real money</li>
      <li>Following community forecasts on niche topics not covered by commercial platforms</li>
      <li>Academic and research contexts</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Who Manifold is for</h2>
    <p>{p.bestFor}</p>

    <h2>Who should skip Manifold</h2>
    <p>{p.skipIf}</p>
    <p>
      If you have already decided you want to trade with real money, go directly to a
      commercial platform. For US residents, that means Kalshi. Outside the US (with
      crypto comfort), that means Polymarket.
    </p>

    <h2>Key facts</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Cost:</strong> Free</li>
      <li><strong>Currency:</strong> {p.currency}</li>
      <li><strong>Regulation:</strong> {p.regulation}</li>
      <li><strong>Minimum deposit:</strong> {p.minDeposit}</li>
      <li><strong>Eligibility:</strong> {p.eligibility.details}</li>
      <li><strong>Mobile app:</strong> {p.mobileApp.notes}</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>The honest limitation</h2>
    <p>
      Play-money prediction markets behave somewhat differently from real-money markets.
      Without financial consequences, some participants take larger or more arbitrary
      positions than they would with real money. The calibration of play-money markets may
      be lower quality than high-volume real-money markets on Kalshi or Polymarket. Use
      Manifold to learn the interface and mechanics — not as a perfect simulator of
      real-money market dynamics.
    </p>

    <h2>Get started</h2>
    <AffiliateCTA platformId="manifold" label="Try Manifold (free)" />
    <p style="font-size:0.85rem; color:var(--ink-soft); margin-top:0.5rem;">
      No affiliate relationship — we do not earn anything from Manifold signups.
      We include it because it is genuinely useful for learning.
    </p>

    <h2>Frequently asked questions</h2>
    <FAQSchema faqs={faqs} />

    <p style="font-size:0.85rem; color:var(--ink-soft); margin-top:2rem;">
      Once you are comfortable with the mechanics and ready to trade real money,
      read our <a href="/what-is-a-prediction-market">platform overview</a> or
      <a href="/compare">compare your options</a>.
      <a href="/risks-and-responsible-trading">Risks and responsible trading →</a>
    </p>

    <RelatedGuides slug="what-is-a-prediction-market-beginners-guide" />
  </article>
</Base>

<style>
  .callout--eligibility { background: #eef6f1; border-left-color: var(--forest, #1f6b4f); }
</style>
